---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Corporate Wellness & Mental Fitness | Fullfill"
  description="Fullfill corporate memberships help teams build mental fitness, manage workplace stress, support emotional fitness, and develop healthier, more resilient habits."
  keywords="corporate wellness, corporate mental fitness, employee wellness, workplace wellbeing, workplace stress, emotional fitness, burnout prevention, mental fitness, Fullfill corporate memberships"
  canonicalPath="/corporate/"
>
  <section class="corporate-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Corporate Memberships</h1>
      <p class="intro-text">Empower your team with Fullfill's corporate wellness and mental fitness solution. Help employees manage stress, build resilience, strengthen emotional fitness, and grow with practical tools for everyday wellbeing.</p>

      <div class="benefits-grid">
        <div class="benefit-card"><h3>Team Wellness</h3><p>Give your organization access to tools that support mental fitness, mindfulness, stress management, reflection, and personal growth.</p></div>
        <div class="benefit-card"><h3>Flexible Plans</h3><p>Flexible membership options designed for organizations of different sizes, with programs tailored to your workforce and goals.</p></div>
        <div class="benefit-card"><h3>Employee Engagement</h3><p>Support employee wellbeing with practical tools for emotional fitness, healthier habits, focus, reflection, and stress relief.</p></div>
        <div class="benefit-card"><h3>Insights &amp; Analytics</h3><p>Understand engagement with aggregated wellness insights and metrics while keeping individual reflections private.</p></div>
        <div class="benefit-card"><h3>Expert Support</h3><p>Get onboarding assistance and support to help your organization introduce Fullfill as part of a broader employee wellbeing strategy.</p></div>
        <div class="benefit-card"><h3>Easy Administration</h3><p>Manage members and access from a simple administration experience designed to make corporate wellbeing easier to roll out.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-section">
        <h2>Ready to Support a Healthier Workforce?</h2>
        <p>Contact us to learn more about Fullfill corporate membership options and how we can support mental fitness and wellbeing at work.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="cta-button">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-section">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>What is Fullfill for businesses?</h3><p>Fullfill is a wellness and mental fitness platform designed to help people build healthier habits, manage stress, reflect, and grow.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>How many employees can be included?</h3><p>Our corporate programs can scale with your organization. Contact us to discuss the right setup for your team.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>Can Fullfill support burnout prevention?</h3><p>Fullfill provides practical tools for stress management, reflection, emotional fitness, focus, and healthier daily habits that can complement an organization's wellbeing strategy.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>Can we customize the program?</h3><p>We can discuss the program structure, access, and organizational requirements that best fit your workforce.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .corporate-section{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 20px}.container{width:100%}h1{font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:20px;color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0)}.intro-text{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:50px;color:var(--text-secondary,#666)}.benefits-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:30px;margin-bottom:60px}.benefit-card{padding:30px;border:1px solid var(--border-color,#e0e0e0);border-radius:8px;background:var(--card-bg,#fafafa);transition:all .3s ease}.benefit-card:hover{box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1);transform:translateY(-4px)}.benefit-card h3{font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0)}.benefit-card p{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-color,#333)}.cta-section{text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#99afff,#9a94ff);padding:60px 40px;border-radius:12px;color:white;margin:60px 0}.cta-section h2{font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:15px}.cta-section p{font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:30px;opacity:.95}.cta-button{display:inline-block;padding:14px 40px;background:white;color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0);text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;transition:all .3s ease}.cta-button:hover{box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.2);transform:translateY(-2px)}.faq-section{margin-top:60px}.faq-section h2{font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:30px;color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0)}.faq-item{margin-bottom:30px;padding-bottom:30px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color,#e0e0e0)}.faq-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}.faq-item h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0)}.faq-item p{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-color,#333)}
  @media(max-width:768px){.corporate-section{padding:40px 15px}h1{font-size:1.8rem}.benefits-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.cta-section{padding:40px 20px}.cta-section h2{font-size:1.5rem}}
</style>
